# Reddit API Credentials
# Get these from https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# 
# Steps to get credentials:
# 1. Go to https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# 2. Click "create another app..." or "create app"
# 3. Choose "script" as the app type
# 4. Name it whatever you want (e.g., "Reddit Image Viewer")
# 5. Description is optional
# 6. Redirect URI: leave blank or use "http://localhost:8001"
# 7. Click "create app"
# 8. Copy the client_id (under the app name, looks like random characters)
# 9. Copy the secret (the "secret" field)
#
# Then copy this file to .env and fill in your credentials:
# cp env.example .env

REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here

